{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1BhaW5raWxsZXJzJTIwJTI4MjAxNSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Painkillers","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/3p3k3VSCiqd2pdb4Qtyon3XlMrA.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/egT0DqS5ZpB4LDkfcf9yjtsbApF.jpg","description":"Led by Major John Cafferty, a squad of US soldiers are sent on a mission,deep into the mountainous regions of Afghanistan with orders to extract a mysterious top secret package. Now they are back home in a military hospital because they have no memory of what happened to them, or even who they are. In time, they start to recall the strange events that occurred: apparitions that appeared, luring some of them to their deaths and readings of a powerful electromagnetic energy from a strange unearthly power source. But there is no time to dwell on the past, they need to face the bitter truth about how they ended up in Afghanistan to begin with and the betrayals that wiped out their minds and nearly destroyed their lives.\n\nReleased 15 Nov 2015 · Canada · Language: English · 105 min\nStudio: Badlands Features, Liberation Pictures, Ferns Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Thriller","Science Fiction","Action","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.0","imdb_id":"tt3171176","moviedb_id":363618,"tmdbId":363618,"runtime":"105 min","cast":["Tahmoh Penikett","Erica Durance","Lesley-Ann Brandt","Colm Feore","Julia Voth","Riza Santos","Caroline Lindy","Amanda Vredegoor"],"director":["Peter Winther"],"writer":["Peter Winther","Jason Groce","kirk ross"],"released":"2015-11-15T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Canada","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Peter Winther","character":"Director"},{"name":"Tahmoh Penikett","character":"Cafferty","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/716vNPQ4UaPga3n8RX777c9Excg.jpg"},{"name":"Erica Durance","character":"Trudy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kshDl70fwwTHO